#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/internal_transfer_with_agreed_amount/wizards/internal_transfer_draft_confirm.py:0
msgid ""
"This payment is part of an internal transfer. Resetting it to draft will "
"also reset the related payment %s and remove the reconciliation between both"
" payments. Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Este pago es parte de una transferencia interna. Restablecerlo a borrador "
"también restablecerá el pago relacionado %s y eliminará la conciliación "
"entre ambos pagos. ¿Desea continuar?"

#. module: internal_transfer_with_agreed_amount
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/internal_transfer_with_agreed_amount/wizards/internal_transfer_multicurrency.py:0
msgid ""
"When both journals use the same currency (%s), the sent and received amounts"
" must be equal."
msgstr ""
"Cuando ambos diarios utilizan la misma moneda (%s), los montos enviado y "
"recibido deben ser iguales."

